  m_text: "EXIT R8 \u2014 RULES OF SURVIVAL\r\n\r\n\u20228 STAGES ahead: Choose the
    door Wisely..\r\n\u2022 OBSERVE carefully: Inspect objects with [E] to verify
    room status.\r\n\u2022 CHOOSE WISELY: 2 doors lead forward. One is SAFE, one
    is LETHAL.\r\n\u2022 DEATH RESETS EVERYTHING: Picking a wrong door resets you
    back to STAGE 1 and reshuffles all stages.\r\n\r\nPress [ENTER], [SPACE], or
    [E] to Begin..."
